# lindenmayer's original algae model, 1968.
#
# `strategy parallel` rewrites every outermost redex at once and does not
# descend into what it just produced, which is exactly what an l-system means
# by a generation.
#
# rewriting one symbol into two nests the spine of the sequence, so the term is
# a tree even though what it stands for is a row of symbols. `view flat` reads
# off the leaves in order instead of pretending the tree is not there.

strategy parallel
view flat

a => a : b
b => a

seed a
